{
  "id": "628ea7936db60e2d5b0b1dd3",
  "title": "快打旋风3",
  "summary": "这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。 作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、艾迪科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。 这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。 本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。 搓招意义不太…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/0eb9f9b083e6599ec08dea13e7c4c464e9cf0afd170cf9f3b3949457c899d823cdbec65336add409b011aa8f3afbbe40b31de52c3d7de5da28e21c31705ec23f54\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a></p>\n<p>这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/403b8ddc94729fa8d40d73dfcff95d35d0e746d2b023cb17d447d90f3c46a57d529e2aa8589e496e0ba4432a9cb257a9e83e0dd35139df3fd7a374682d8b444faa9ba84893bdbcfd8db5cad7fcd014\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_043\"></a></p>\n<p>作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》<sup><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/fccba6d23cb4dd35cd8397face93e351a2b937738b6e2a4b3adff2452973c71e6ef0bf4c4d86810d6f2beb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[2]</a></sup> 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、<del>艾迪</del>科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e8e6797a08c93a1d0dd1d4c28436c8fc5f9b5ac454a573f90ce7f333fec7369dd439502a0872cf986b7172c77905eeb7069d5ba21c3e93dc87e2969d02f0bcf9bb60201a8113aa7e799bcb656c6c74\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/77fd6955e11f47d8e06fd3fba51f66f20e0f59eb1c21608206077fc1e95caba410ed4fe282337cb2b58e8d23290b7f94839c9a37e9d6bb29aa45ccc97ebfadbfb2a499a57f5b5903491aa7d3e5c3c1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_014\"></a></p>\n<p>本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ec67da2b0045802fca39f5e995a46b7ca6af36334f7cdf5b9dae717e816a3052df81e9259403d15e43a746808eebb0207181721e38c9e4a28b02ad4d715ef025d4b53bb083d876967ff7ba0832839f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_008\"></a></p>\n<p>搓招意义不太大，起码对于女主露西亚是这样。升龙腿收招破绽极大，除了耍帅，就只有落地挨揍的用处。而那个SUPER气槽存在的时间又短，BOSS战时难以抓住时机，也是只能装B用。最实用的还是跑动攻击，手速够的话能把敌人连到死，也挺爽。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/28bfbdb9a97ec558fdaeec0d7ea47db4553193fae1e2369a702dce756b44020e7e077dfe41a5bb199ba24ce46ee247ac18aeae7f3aa6d0ab1e4182aa1d3031f6dfe895b843fa7d76500b918ef63eae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_003\"></a></p>\n<p>清版动作最重要的还是那说不清道不明的打击感。本作这方面还行，但从出品时间来看，比对面的格斗四人组系列还是稍逊一筹。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6d721d1bcd888187928d87e1241d59fabfe75df02c65d03bea0e09fc120b414fc44cc301438634163df7a2571c693751db71f533220eedb2ed3b87d1501aa3a2a3ddcb02702282590c7c0fccbb19e0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_028\"></a></p>\n<p>分支路线算特色吗？在1995年这个时间点看来不算，只能算“借鉴”来的。但某些路线可以跳过BOSS，也是挺值得的。有一条不太容易出现的路线是唐人街，场景设计还是挺赞的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ba7295a2dff7d72a51cf7b94449ce12f462a1ef1eac88baf92839e3d9361c64ad5e6087fb27d888adee2594107079c8ef8835269ddd8b29e676b2a40bfc524c04eba946a613549651d85db9854e759\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_030\"></a></p>\n<p>只是这一关的BOSS嘛，有点刻板印象了。这只BOSS会点穴嘿！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/9e82352e4a69501967a5ce2238550b34dd084f876fa0e976bbc16eac22a611b66e3d03b4e51f64564095ac18b36e00981179edac813ef60b2fc61c14f516d7e9409f1823bc34de182e464fc437f7b6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_063\"></a></p>\n<p>其余的BOSS们。只打一遍可是会认不全的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/04d61bec0ee99c7a42a55005394cf2f438fd54c240157f2034a43047a6551fc0d0e29ea2bc123593f6d261292402d526a556c769209f10d2966518489cf46c7f64b0e8a458188e2c8840c75db84d9c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_006\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3ef266a5a22073d3d30329fb94ff3a580766c1ae24aacb5178371a7d5589ae4c46f2fd22c17f07a0184fe68e722d288d1138e19b076b027d7ccbd8d5616dc9e5894ac7ef34857bb2191e651f62dacf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/31ddd1598f86d494ba03b30e0101fee1d9d47538ed83d7e2d52e550dad2755c911adb07ca7f66b68cedc4335ef6f673aa2872d6650e1ad62b0e2ba9f14e2dc37722b09de8a795155e1064aeb4e61de\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_048\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/10aa1bb7b217d75787e48210b57ddbed4e6b73560c500e09d1d08e02ab256bbf167ef47d2e297b1d5f24058d50b700a139fbda1402709c63bfa4980a6fd427e4e80c113c7349a03b69481acf28e687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f09ca2d86721b61114481cdc60a335374f17f16406e18d228b18a63acbf1f7d977aaffefa083953ae4bec5c6547b85475701582969f2b311a023bc02580a514eb46952aa0cc49fc1bf2f1bb63d2e99\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_019\"></a></p>\n<p>最终BOSS，只要不被抓住，不难。最后死在电网上，哪怕不是在电网这侧打死的，也会强行漂移过去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a242eff2c86b30e0c62926ca635c70a9aced05d40a55b6ccbdccbf28ecda4452d437319c49037dac3296be0395d3833079bd25fab4f43c48cc7a9813bccaf1a1fae6df7f7cbdcbe91f16790fae2e13\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ea2a7fe34c96378d052424c9220badaa44b05e961c0ff75da4e9bbc48154ddce965248ca0a43b285d835162a8df86303a69ace57794cb7a9f52c0eab2779f6402ee0df1fdff5777c1836444fa0a3d7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_025\"></a></p>\n<p>通关画面，明显男主角金毛的迪恩跟另外三个尿不到一个坑里。迪恩在卡普空后续的其它游戏里再没出现过。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1ee5ba7e101ea5319afe70d0fa60473026739a13248bbb3048c40a42fe7f4c74e728a56b05587db5d090f4280be8f575c6c7fb3ca1a6f053827a820012c6e3af707fdf30a436a271195ff2ac06d8a9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_031\"></a></p>\n<p>选最高难度才能出现真正的结局，也就是“END”这三个字。不值！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e3c2743e17096aa6f69f2605d67163f6354fd8f6b1b9c313f31a35ee0b501807f4d8dd35c80bea801552e9a15f885afe8fe1c84f62931fa47d0178d5744a4255f69ca430d1e57955fd049baee29391\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4b22315808afa3c937e11ec3d161c0d4f9ad892059f740be3f1242d3c1213e38f65c477803e125d6bd73beef78d106d1566e0a0b08cd0b4ee6a2f32b4c2e228cfb4011b5085479d76c30b6cfc0eef7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_032\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(2)</a>：Street Fighter = 陆港街头霸王=台快打旋风，Final Fight = 陆港快打旋风 = 台街头快打</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/final-fight-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/11/darkwing-duck.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">狡猾飞天德</a><span>[53%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/08/ninja-ryuuken-den-tomoe.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者龙剑传：巴</a><span>[51%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/03/tenchi-o-kurau-ii-shokatsu-koumei-den.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">吞食天地2：诸葛孔明传</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2019/05/e-v-o-search-of-enden.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">46亿年物语</a><span>[38%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
